  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pol 206.14 Concluding Proceeding. No party shall be required to rest his/her case at a particular time, except when the presiding officer is reasonably certain that all relevant evidence, rebuttal and re-rebuttal have been heard.\n\nSource. #5836, eff 6-15-94; ss by #7302, eff 6-8-00; ss by #9167, INTERIM, eff 6-3-08, EXPIRES: 11-30-08; ss and moved by #9223-A, eff 8-1-08 (from Pol 206.13)",
